# @hub-lanes

# fleet-propagate (operator line, outside managed blocks; the operator 2026-09-14 "Yes sync
# and rebake on every bin change"). Every 5 minutes: if origin/main moved and the
# diff touches a path the fleet actually runs (bin/, prompts/, fly/, rules/,
# skills/, cron/, catalog/, checks/, guardrails/, worker/, fleet.conf,
# vercel.conf), sync the hub, ssh every fleet.conf box through update-runners.sh,
# and rebake every pool image — so a merge reaches the fleet in minutes instead of
# at tomorrow's 05:17Z. The 05:17Z and 05:40Z lines above stay as the backstop.
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/fleet-propagate.sh >> /root/harness/logs/fleet-propagate-cron.log 2>&1
